{
    "title": "CarKey: Car Play & Digital Key",
    "description": "App Description\r\nThanks to new-cutting edge technology, KeyConnect enhances smart control and safety of your cars.\r\nKeyConnect is the 1st carplay app to MANAGE MULTIPLE car keys in single phone.\r\n\r\nFeatures that matter:\r\n+ WIRELESSLY LOCK & UNLOCK car door from home, office, or anywhere without delay. No hardware required. You don't even need to come close your cars. Remote lock & unlock will save your day if you lose car key or lock car key inside car. \r\n\r\n+ Ensure drive safety before departure. Remote CHECK LIVE vehicle engine status including tire pressure, oil / EV battery level, and receive safety alerts to avoid risks of road accidents or engine breakdown when driving.\r\n\r\n+ Share car key securely with BANK-GRADE SECURITY protocol. Share car key digitally with car renters without physical key exchange or with other family members in need.\r\n\r\n+ SMART NAVIGATION to remotely locate your car or find fastest routes to car parks or gas / EV charging stations on maps. \r\n\r\n+ KeyConnect supports 20+ car makes: Audi, BMW, Buick, Cadillac, Chevrolet, Chrysler, Dodge, Ford, GMC, Hyundai, Jaguar, Jeep, Land Rover, Lexus, Lincoln, Nissan, RAM, Tesla, Toyota, Volkswagen.\r\n\r\nWe're working with car manufacturers to support more car makes and improve overal carplay keyless experience.\r\n\r\nKeyConnect helps connect & control your cars. Remote Lock and unlock car, carplay and much more.",
    "descriptionHTML": "App Description<br>Thanks to new-cutting edge technology, KeyConnect enhances smart control and safety of your cars.<br>KeyConnect is the 1st carplay app to MANAGE MULTIPLE car keys in single phone.<br><br>Features that matter:<br>+ WIRELESSLY LOCK &amp; UNLOCK car door from home, office, or anywhere without delay. No hardware required. You don&#39;t even need to come close your cars. Remote lock &amp; unlock will save your day if you lose car key or lock car key inside car. <br><br>+ Ensure drive safety before departure. Remote CHECK LIVE vehicle engine status including tire pressure, oil / EV battery level, and receive safety alerts to avoid risks of road accidents or engine breakdown when driving.<br><br>+ Share car key securely with BANK-GRADE SECURITY protocol. Share car key digitally with car renters without physical key exchange or with other family members in need.<br><br>+ SMART NAVIGATION to remotely locate your car or find fastest routes to car parks or gas / EV charging stations on maps. <br><br>+ KeyConnect supports 20+ car makes: Audi, BMW, Buick, Cadillac, Chevrolet, Chrysler, Dodge, Ford, GMC, Hyundai, Jaguar, Jeep, Land Rover, Lexus, Lincoln, Nissan, RAM, Tesla, Toyota, Volkswagen.<br><br>We&#39;re working with car manufacturers to support more car makes and improve overal carplay keyless experience.<br><br>KeyConnect helps connect &amp; control your cars. Remote Lock and unlock car, carplay and much more.",
